Turn Your Old Phone Into a Smart Display
Many people have an old smartphone at home.
A new web app gives it a new job.
The app can turn the old phone into a smart display.
People can see the time, weather, calendar, and other useful information.
The phone can stay on a desk or a table.
It can also show photos and reminders.
The app works in a web browser.
People do not need to install a special operating system.
This makes it easy to start using.
The idea helps people use old phones instead of throwing them away.
It can save money and reduce electronic waste.
The writer says an old phone can still be useful with the right software.
